.000136, 0.00013, 0.999354, 0.000646]], "Hey Alicia,\n\nSo I've been looking at the Q4 numbers and honestly I'm kind of worried. Revenue is down about eight percent from last quarter, and I think a lot of that comes from the churn in the mid tier accounts. I don't know, like maybe we raised prices too fast. Can you pull the cancellation reasons for the last sixty days and send them over?\n\nOkay, switching gears. The holiday party is coming up and I need to lock in the caterer by Wednesday. I'm leaning toward the Italian place, but Greg wants tacos, so I guess we need to just pick one. What do you think?\n\nAnd finally, I saw that you posted the job description for the designer role. It looks good, but I think the salary range is too low, like we'll never get anyone good at that number. Let's talk about it tomorrow."),
